  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.04 Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.04 “Board” means “board” as defined in RSA 310:2, I(a), reprinted in Appendix B. The term includes the executive director for any board that is advisory and for any profession for which the practice act does not establish a board or otherwise confers authority on the executive director.\n\nSource. #12863, eff 9-4-19; ss by #13293, eff 11-24-21; ss by #13797, eff 10-26-23; ss by #14135, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
